sequenceDiagram
    actor Owner as Operator
    participant Agent as Harness agent
    participant Guard as ToolPolicy and policy
    participant Tool as Tool adapter
    participant HTTP as HTTP broker
    participant Target as Target destination
    participant Store as Private stores

    Note over Agent,HTTP: Engagement layer ON<br/>Target scope management is a separate switch
    Agent->>Guard: Tool name and arguments
    Guard->>Guard: Describe destinations and effects
    Guard->>Guard: Apply scope mode, trusted-read rules and effect judgment
    opt A check needs an owner decision
        Guard->>Owner: Show exact operation in review UI
        Owner-->>Guard: Allow once, always allow, or keep blocked
    end
    alt Any required check remains blocked
        Guard-->>Agent: Redacted error
    else All required checks pass
        Guard->>Tool: Dispatch exact authorized call
        Tool->>HTTP: Request with optional identity ID
        HTTP->>HTTP: Recheck effects, URL and DNS addresses
        Note over Owner,HTTP: Broker checks can also request owner decisions
        HTTP->>HTTP: Enforce budgets and bind credentials
        HTTP->>Target: DNS-pinned request
        Target-->>HTTP: Bounded response
        HTTP->>Store: Redacted evidence and trajectory
        HTTP-->>Tool: Redacted result and evidence reference
        Tool->>Store: Graph discoveries where applicable
        Tool-->>Agent: Tool result
    end
